$DATUM Methyl isopropyl ketone O-(1,2-dibromethyl)-oxime (IV). Following the
above procedure, from 0.1 g (0.8 mmol) of compound III and 0.12 g (0.8
mmol) of bromine we obtained 0.2 g of a mixture consisting of 0.14 g of a
light brown mobile liquid, which contained about (49%) of dibromo
derivative IV. Brown tarry material, yield 0.06 g, (80% ). Adduct IV was
a mixture of E and Z isomers at a ratio of 6 : 1. IR spectrum (film), ν ,
cm-1: 3041 w, 2970 s, 2932 m, 2873 m, 1761 w, 1715 m, 1641 m, 1467 m,
1422 m, 1387 w, 1368 m, 1344 m, 1272 w, 1254 w, 1237 w, 1215 m, 1184 w,
1147 m, 1112 s, 1024 s, 986 m, 916 s, 888 m, 839 m, 772 w, 739 w, 669 m,
588 s. 1H NMR spectrum (CDCl3),δ , ppm: E isomer: 6.52 d.d (1H, α -H, 3J
α, β = 10.0, J α, β' = 2.7 Hz), 4.06 d.d (1H, β " -H, 2J β ,β" = 11.0
Hz), 3.91 d.d (1H, β' -H), 3.32 sept (1H, CH, 3JHH = 7.0 Hz), 1.06 d (6H,
CH3). 13C NMR spectrum (CDCl3), δC, ppm: E isomer: 168.09 (C≡ N), 88.87
(Cα), 34.46 (CH), 32.90 (C), 19.63 [CH(CH3)2], 12.30 (CH3); Z isomer:
168.09 (C=N), 88.87 (C β ), 32.83 (C), 27.58 (CH), 19.05 [CH(CH3)2],
15.54(CH3). IR spectrum of the tarry material (film), δ , cm-1: 3351 s,
br, 3141 s, br, 2975 w, 2936 w, 2875 w, 2751 s, br, 1688 m, 1467 m, 1423
w, 1371 m, 1092 m, 1060 m, 980 w, 939 w, 893 w, 777 w, 596 w.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM stereoselective, 6:1 E:Z
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Reactivity of Benzophenone O-Vinyloxime
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
